{"id":"n57314-2-7","stage":1,"title":"잠자다 · 积压","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57314-2-7-1","ko":"네가 공부를 안 하니까 책들이 책장에서 잠자고 있구나.","zh":"因为你不好好学习，那些书才一直在书架上闲置着呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하니까","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책들이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책장에서","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠자고","meaning":"积压，闲置","explanation":"잠자다：积压，闲置；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잠자다","audio":"/audio/4033044b80a133c39cb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57314","senseId":"2","lemma":"잠자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있구나.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"4033044b80a133c3","term":"잠자다","zh":"积压，闲置","audio":"/audio/4033044b80a133c39cb4.mp3","entryId":"57314","definition":"东西不被使用或原本的用途无法再使用。","pronunciation":["잠자다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/13ca82a44a5f3da62db0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57314-2-7-2","ko":"아니에요, 엄마. 가끔 꺼내서 봐요.","zh":"不是的，妈妈。我偶尔会拿出来看的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니에요,","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꺼내서","meaning":"拿出，掏出，取出","explanation":"꺼내다：拿出，掏出，取出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"꺼내다","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62265","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","entryId":"65204","definition":"不经常，偶然一次。","pronunciation":["가끔"]},{"id":"eda7321c0e7ec22a","term":"꺼내다","zh":"拿出，掏出，取出","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3","entryId":"62265","definition":"把里面的东西拿到外面。","pronunciation":["꺼ː내다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b182d101fb3d4bc4f06.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57314","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不是的，妈妈。我偶尔会拿出来看的。","工作有困难吗？","因为你不好好学习，那些书才一直在书架上闲置着呢。"],"answer":2},{"li